{"q":{"g":"In this quest you have to plant 3 WI-FI Cameras inside the crane cockpits on Factory. They can only be entered from the top via the rafters. Placing each camera requires you to be stationary for 40 seconds, so be sure to secure the area first.","sh":[{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/3/36/The_Walls_Have_Eyes_Map.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240826234035","c":"Locations marked on map"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/3/3a/WallsHaveEyesPlantLocation1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240826232507","c":"Cockpit #1 above the \"Gate 3\" extraction."},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/9/9a/WallsHaveEyesPlacement2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240826232555","c":"Cockpit #2 above the \"Med Tent Gate\" extraction."},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/0/01/WallsHaveEyes3rdPlacement.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240826232226","c":"Cockpit #3 opposite the \"Gate 0\" extraction."}]},"o":{},"x":{}}